Package: pqkerberos
Version: __VERSION__
Section: security
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: default-jre | java17-runtime, libpam-runtime, netcat-openbsd
Maintainer: nemal2 <nemalx@pqkerberos>
Description: Post-Quantum Kerberos Authentication System (reference implementation)
 A Kerberos-style authentication system built on NIST post-quantum
 cryptography: Kyber-768 (FIPS 203) for key encapsulation and
 Dilithium-3 (FIPS 204) for digital signatures. Ships a system daemon,
 a PAM module for sudo/login integration, and pqk-exec for gating
 individual commands behind a live PQ-Kerberos challenge.
 .
 This is a reference / educational implementation — see
 /usr/share/doc/pqkerberos/SECURITY.md before using it outside a lab.
